MdjeBot
Maintained by Mdje

MdjeBot is a modified version (fork) of "PasarguardBot", originally written by
Amir Kenzo (https://github.com/AmirKenzo/PasarguardBot) and licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 together with the Commons Clause
License Condition v1.0.

Modifications by Mdje (2026):
  - Renamed the project, packages, scripts, container image, services and
    session files from "PasarguardBot" to "MdjeBot".
  - Replaced branding, links, support/contact details and descriptions with
    those of Mdje.
  - Added the Bot Builder (builder/, builder_main.py, docker-compose service
    "builder"): a Telegram bot that provisions and bills customer bot instances.
  - Added panel sales to the Bot Builder: customers buy an admin account on the
    operator's Pasarguard panel, which is created and connected to their bot
    automatically (builder/services/panels, app/cli/panel_link.py).
  - Redesigned the default bot messages and made the default buttons use the
    "glass" style (app/i18n/locales/fa.json, app/db/crud/keyboards.py).

